      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ADHANA KEVIN (7) boasts strong form at this course and distance having won four times from five starts. Was out of the placings last time (26.16) at this track in a Special conditions race, finishing sixth and beaten 3.5 lengths. Looks suited here and rates on top. DARLING DANGER (1) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only 1.75 lengths from the winner Frenzy in second(19.93) at this track. Will give a great sight again. TOKYO DANGER (2) was unfancied last time out but hit the ground running to lead all the way, scoring by half a length (19.82) at this track in a Grade 5 over 340m. Can make it back-to-back wins. GOOD LUCK BABE (8) will be hard to beat with a drop in distance.",
